  "limits": [
    "Pool Panic Endless extends its late-game pressure after six unchanged opening flags. Later authored formations add original Pogo Zombies, Dancing Zombies with native Backups, and Redeye Gargantuars alongside the existing specials, with bounded increases in formation density, shorter intervals and heavier rosters. Original combat statistics remain unchanged. New complete formations wait when the existing living actors plus that formation would exceed 128; native children remain native and can exceed this admission threshold after spawning. Accepted cards, developing defenses, automatic checkpoints, saved supply randomness and existing save layouts are preserved. All fifteen cards, accepted artwork, the compact native Menu/speed controls and every earlier mode remain unchanged. Full original parity and indefinite successful play remain unverified.",
    "Focused production-method tests and build checks do not replace broad game or browser validation.",
    "Earlier release results remain historical parent evidence. Any reused current-O2 opening prefix is explicitly sealed, source/artifact-equivalent and revalidated; it is not described as reexecuted. No separately image-generated challenge illustrations are active."
  ]
